  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nAfter you take damage, heal
    1 HP. Shared 1-second cooldown.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Score multiplier:
    +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three
    units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nAn elected keeper
    of a root settlement, they inherited a crown meant to be buried when their term
    ended. The frozen season never let that day arrive. They seek a spring that will
    let somebody else lead.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal
    passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated
    percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed
    support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: archive, regal, mask.
    Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
